  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1725390747_6831022_0044d13ca137550d1478472a909ff1e9.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">MUSE</strong>&nbsp;has been created to help you thrive in your beauty business by providing the tools you need to work more efficiently and earn more money as a nail technician.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Our EFiles, Dust Extractors and EFile Bits have been created, hand-picked and tested by us, industry professionals, to ensure the highest quality and suitability for nail technicians.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Launched in 2024,<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">&nbsp;MUSE</strong>&nbsp;was created by Becci from&nbsp;<a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color--body); text-decoration-line: none;\" title=\"http://www.blossom-academy.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.blossom-academy.co.uk/\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Blossom Academy</strong></a><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">&nbsp;</strong>who has over 10 years experience in the nail and beauty industry. Becci ran a successful, fully booked nail business for 7 years, then moved on to training as an educator so she could pass on her skills, passion and knowledge to both beginners and existing nail technicians.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Our&nbsp;</strong><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color--body); text-decoration-line: none;\" title=\"http://blossom-academy.co.uk/product/efile-group-course/\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://blossom-academy.co.uk/product/efile-group-course/\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">EFile Course&nbsp;</strong></a>is hosted at Blossom Academy in Shrewsbury, Shropshire and taught by Becci, so she can pass on her extensive knowledge on electric nail files. We guarantee, you'll leave the course full of knowledge, skills and confidence to use an&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color--body); text-decoration-line: none;\" title=\"The Muse E-File\" href=\"https://musefile.com/products/e-file\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">EFile</strong></a>&nbsp;on your clients!</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">We are all about enabling you to be your own&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Muse</strong>, because your biggest competition should only ever be yourself. Our products will help you to progress your skills, enhance client experience and save you time in your day, so you can charge more and work on your own terms.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">We understand how individual every nail technician is and creating your own style is key. Each&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">MUSE</strong>&nbsp;product is available in various colours, so you can choose your own aesthetic.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Plus all MUSE products come with a&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color--body); text-decoration-line: none;\" title=\"Refund Policy\" href=\"https://musefile.com/policies/refund-policy\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">1 year no-quibble, guarantee</strong></a>!</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Let us help you be the best nail technician you can. Grow your beauty business with&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">MUSE</strong>.</p>",
